        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Angel's Feather is a Japanese boys' love visual novel game created by BlueImpact, which was originally released on April 25, 2003 for PC, and later ported to the PlayStation 2 by KID. It was adapted into an OVA, which was animated by Studio Venet. The game's character designer is Yamamoto Kazue. In 2007, Media Blasters licensed the anime for Region 1 release.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Angel's Feather es una novela visual japonesa de tipo boys' love creada por BlueImpact, lanzada originalmente el 25 de abril de 2003 para PC y posteriormente portada a PlayStation 2 por KID. Fue adaptada a un OVA animado por Studio Venet. La diseñadora de personajes del juego es Yamamoto Kazue. En 2007, Media Blasters licenció el anime para su lanzamiento en la Región 1.",
          "source": "claude",
